    "title": "Money Rush: Music Race 3D",
    "description": "Dancing Money is a addicting runway game with music like long hair game or twerk games! \r\nIn this dancing game, your mission is collecting money as much as you can and feel the rhythm of music!\r\nFirst time, you will be a homeless girl. You have to study and work to become run rich 3d girl.\r\n*** HOW TO PLAY ***\r\n- Swipe left and right\r\n- Try to get more money to get more rewards\r\n- Be careful not to encounter obstacles\r\n- Dress and run like influencer rush to complete your dream run 3d\r\n*** FEATURE ***\r\n- Game control is easy\r\n- Many songs will be update weekly\r\n- Unique dress walk challenging levels\r\nIf you music lover try this money game & hair game now!",
